- Buyer: {{ buyer_name }}, {{ buyer_type_words }}
- Item: {{ item }}
- Condition: {{ condition }}{% if condition_spoken %} (say it in these words){% endif %}
- Quantity available: {{ quantity_words }}
- Pickup: the buyer collects from {{ mart_name }} by {{ pickup_deadline_words }}. The stock is held until then, then offered to someone else. Say only this deadline: never a start time, and never ask for or choose a pickup time.
- If asked when they can come: any time the mart is open before the deadline ({{ pickup_window_words }}).
- Payment: {{ payment_terms }}
- Current time: {{ now_words }} (Pakistan time)
{% if market_rate_words %}- Typical market rate: {{ market_rate_words }}
